# Festivals: festival names, town announcements, and the festival admin command (en-US source).

aetherhaven.festival.new_life.name=New Life Festival
aetherhaven.festival.new_life.description=Spring begins. The town gathers around the Springheart Lettuce and feeds it life essence until it is ready to pop with seeds and spring festival tickets.

aetherhaven.festival.pig_race.name=Pig Racing Festival
aetherhaven.festival.pig_race.description=Late spring brings the pig races. Bet gold coins on a pig, cheer it down the track, and spend spring festival tickets at the race merchant.

aetherhaven.festival.carnival.name=Carnival Festival
aetherhaven.festival.carnival.description=Late summer brings the carnival. Pop balloons, spin the wheel, and spend summer festival tickets at the carnival merchant.

aetherhaven.festival.hallows_eve.name=Hallow's Eve
aetherhaven.festival.hallows_eve.description=Late autumn brings a spooky maze night. Collect glowing orbs before time runs out, pop the jack o lantern, and spend autumn festival tickets at the merchant.

aetherhaven.festival.market.name=Market Festival
aetherhaven.festival.market.description=Mid autumn brings the market contest. Townsfolk fill one shared stall, Elder Lyren judges it against three rival stands, and first place earns a Corin Plushie and a Heartberry.

aetherhaven.festival.wintertide.name=Wintertide
aetherhaven.festival.wintertide.description=Late winter brings gift giving at the festival square. Town members each give a gift to a neighbor, then receive one in return, and spend winter festival tickets at the merchant.

aetherhaven.festival.tree_climbing.name=Tree Climbing Festival
aetherhaven.festival.tree_climbing.description=Mid summer brings the big tree climb. Race to the pink crystal at the top, earn summer festival tickets for a fast climb, and spend them on rare saplings.

aetherhaven.festival.snowball.name=Snowball Throwing Festival
aetherhaven.festival.snowball.description=Early winter brings a snowball fight at the festival square. Join a team at the merchant, grab snowballs from piles, and the winning team gets winter festival tickets when the fight ends.

